    '}\n' +
    '```\n' +
    '\n' +
    "Membership with no horizon, synced in the conversation's own group with the messages' audience, proves `present`/`absent` after acquisition unless a pending prediction blocks absence. `loading` means acquisition or later withdrawal. Never add `with own keys` to admin-written memberships.\n" +
    'Queueing needs no membership answer: only `denied`, or fresh, non-revalidating `absent`, disables Send. Stale offline absence still queues; the server authorizes or refuses at sync. `loading`/`partial` never disable.\n' +
