    '`waitSeconds: 0` returns at custody; `inFlight` covers the call, not settlement. After session readiness, acquisition never gates admission. Identity I/O gets 15 seconds excluding prior admissions; `usePendingWrites()` says “not yet admitted”. Reload loses this call. Identification resumes admission in order; `E_ADMISSION_STORE`/`E_ADMISSION_TIMEOUT` permit retry after repair without remounting.\n' +
    'Clear on submit; restore refused text only into an empty draft, otherwise offer Edit/Dismiss. Show “Sending…” on predicted rows (`pending: true`).\n' +
