    '\n' +
    '## Honest read boundaries\n' +
    '\n' +
    '`query(op, args)` waits for publishable device/server data and app authority: ready or denied, never loading. Retired/expired answers reread: four rounds, 30 seconds including queues/authority (while runnable); exhaustion refuses retryable `E_QUERY_RETRY`. Admitted writes precede ready data. `online only` waits online; offline: permitted device data or immediate `E_OFFLINE`. Closed/signed-out/replaced/restored stores retain their refusals. Ready may be partial/stale; `existence(await query(...))` excludes loading.\n' +
    'Use `existence(read)`; after `isReady(read)`, `read.existence` narrows point data.\n' +
    '\n' +
    '| Meaning | UI decision |\n' +
    '| --- | --- |\n' +
    '| `loading` | No answer yet or withheld: keep composers, headers and routes mounted. |\n' +
    '| `denied` | Refusal: show its message; disable the durable action. |\n' +
    '| `present` | Nonempty top-level value: render it, even with incomplete coverage. |\n' +
    '| `absent` | Proven empty answer: resolve the missing route/row. |\n' +
